{"availability":"available","full":"BUDEGlobalEnterprise/bude-suite","name":"bude-suite","description":"Bude RFID Inventory backend — Frappe/ERPNext API layer for the Bude mobile app suite","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-14T17:23:42Z","updated":"2026-10-08T02:00:07Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://demo-stock.budeglobal.in/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:28.784Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:28.784Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:28.784Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T09:24:34.236Z","stars":2,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T19:01:44.744Z","stars":2,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:28.784Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( [](LICENSE) []( [](#product-preview) [](#status) [](docs/PRODUCT.md) [](#live-demo)","Server-side extension for an ERPNext / Frappe site. Exposes whitelisted API methods that the Bude mobile app suite calls; never modifies ERPNext standard DocTypes.","Bude Suite is a mobile-first companion for ERPNext: four native Flutter apps (Inventory, HR, Sales, Helpdesk) covering RFID/barcode stock operations, attendance and leave, field sales and CRM, and ticketing — all working offline-first and syncing back to standard ERPNext documents. This repository is the API layer those apps talk to. No custom DocTypes, no proprietary data layer: every mutation lands on a standard ERPNext record."],"features":["📦 Inventory — RFID / barcode scanning, stock transfers, cycle counts, warehouse dashboards","👥 HR — Attendance check-in/out, leave requests, team management","💼 Sales & CRM — Provider-neutral CRM, offline field visits, order-to-cash, quotation workflows","🎫 Helpdesk — Ticket queue, SLA tracking, assignment & notifications","🔌 Offline-first — Sync back to standard ERPNext documents when connectivity returns"],"sourceUrl":"https://github